# Runtime secret contract

This file documents names only. It intentionally contains no secret values.

Required/current runtime names may include:

OPENAI_API_KEY=
ADIGUN_ADMIN_EMAIL=
ADIGUN_AGENT_KEY=
GITHUB_TOKEN=
AI_ADMIN_KEY=
ML_SERVICE_URL=

Provider-specific deployments may map these names into their own secret managers.

Never commit real values to this file or any browser-served asset.
